# Normalise line endings so the repository is identical regardless of who clones it.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file to CRLF and a Linux one to LF, which
# turns "did anything change?" into a question about the contributor's operating system. It
# also matters here specifically: `pnpm demo` hashes the policy YAML into
# `policy_version.hash`, and a line-ending change would silently alter that hash — making a
# policy look modified when only the checkout differed.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.node binary
